OL,5,G2000 How the Nazis Lost the War
OL,6,     FNazi leadership appeared unified,
OL,7,     Fbut behind the scenes, it was
OL,8,     Fmarked by nepotism, corruption,
OL,9,     Fand fear. The hierarchy was
OL,10,     Fambitious, ruthless, and
OL,11,     Fcutthroat, with leaders competing
OL,12,     Ffor power.
